# build context of the airflow image (the repo root): only the dags, the dbt and meltano projects and the requirements
# files go in. paths are relative to the repo root, not to this file
*
!DataWarehouseAirflow
!DataWarehouseDbt
!DataWarehouseMeltano
!docker/airflow/requirements*.txt

# written by dbt and meltano on Windows: the image runs dbt deps and meltano install itself, and target/ and logs/ are
# written at run time
DataWarehouseDbt/target
DataWarehouseDbt/logs
DataWarehouseDbt/dbt_packages
DataWarehouseMeltano/.meltano
DataWarehouseMeltano/output
DataWarehouseMeltano/.env
# written by python when a dag is imported
**/__pycache__
